  "slug": "loss-prevention-count-sheet-form",
  "title": "Loss Prevention Count Sheet Form",
  "subtitle": "A practical reconciliation count sheet for loss prevention that connects identity, observations and evidence, decision authority, exception ownership, and accountable closeout.",
  "description": "An original retail-operations reconciliation count sheet for loss prevention covering loss-prevention controls and evidence, evidence references, authorization, escalation, operating limits, disposition, and handoff without copying a third-party form.",
  "use_case": "Use when a authorized loss-prevention lead opens one loss prevention record to set the count basis, preserve expected and observed values, reconcile variances, authorize a result, and hand off unresolved lines; closure requires a documented outcome, evidence route, responsible owner, and recipient acknowledgment.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
